          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. [Śulba-Sūtras] Give a method to obtain a rectangle of the same area as a given triangle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.136,
            0.846,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. [Śulba-Sūtras] An isosceles triangle can be converted into a rectangle by dissection in a simpler way. Can you find out how to do it?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.411,
            0.191,
            0.582,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 3,
